# Integer overflow is DS4003 (D-014): DataFusion wraps, so the engine checks.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| extend big = tolong(amount) * 9223372036854775807
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `*` does not fit in a `long`
  --> query:2:16
  |
2 | | extend big = tolong(amount) * 9223372036854775807
  |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: a `long` holds whole numbers from -9223372036854775808 to 9223372036854775807
